						<name>Rogian Commune</name>
						<adjective>Hyper-Tantric</adjective>
						<memberName>Hyper-Tantran</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Wise Bodhisattva</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Wise Bodhisattva</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Adams Genesis sat on a park bench for twenty years as she contemplated our world. With her insight, she wrote our founding book. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Adams punished them severely. Adams's speech at a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Hyper-Tantric Eulogy&lt;/color&gt; inspired many to lead an unified life.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Adams Genesis sat on a park bench for twenty years as she contemplated our world. With her insight, she wrote our founding book. Some of the false believers tried to break the rules and decide their own paths. Adams punished them severely. Adams's speech at a %%ritual0_name%% inspired many to lead an unified life.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>SpiralsC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.431, 0.381, 0.842, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginBuddhist</li>
