						<name>Dopistry</name>
						<adjective>dopist</adjective>
						<memberName>Doper</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. The spirits can reveal their nature to us when we expand our consciousness using the tools we have been given to do so. An ancient text says that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. The spirits can reveal their nature to us when we expand our consciousness using the tools we have been given to do so. An ancient text says that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Olive</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.906, 0.663, 0.178, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
