						</foundation>
						<name>Ideo-Animalism</name>
						<adjective>animalistic</adjective>
						<memberName>Animalist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Big Dog</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Big Dog</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that the animals are our partners in this world, and it's wrong to treat them as any less. I didn't believe it myself until a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;hermit crab&lt;/color&gt; whispered it to me."

  - Rada Moon's letter to Lewis O'Neal</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that the animals are our partners in this world, and it's wrong to treat them as any less. I didn't believe it myself until a %%animal0_thingDef_label%% whispered it to me."

  - Rada Moon's letter to Lewis O'Neal</descriptionTemplate>
