						<name>Sacred Sect</name>
						<adjective>Ranch-Anabaptist</adjective>
						<memberName>Ranch-Anabaptist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Herder</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Herder</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt; created the animals, and then man, and gave the animals to man to cherish and raise and slaughter as acts of veneration towards her. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt;. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% created the animals, and then man, and gave the animals to man to cherish and raise and slaughter as acts of veneration towards %%deity0_objective%%. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by %%deity0_name%%. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>CirclesB</iconDef>
