						<leaderTitleMale>Moral Dog</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Dog</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Yutaka Kent built an army that spread his power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under his rule. One day while walking the streets, Yutaka was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Yutaka's followers demonstrated their devotion by cutting and burning their own flesh.</description>
