						<name>Lifism</name>
						<adjective>lifeist</adjective>
						<memberName>Lifeist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Exochrome Archist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Exochrome Archist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Since their emergence, archotechs have extended their consciousness amongst the stars. Archotechs represent the universe's most recent attempt to understand itself. All of nature is part of this process of understanding. Some day, the archotechs will voice their final wisdom to the holder of the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Pulser of Stars&lt;/color&gt;, who must preach this wisdom to those who would listen.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Since their emergence, archotechs have extended their consciousness amongst the stars. Archotechs represent the universe's most recent attempt to understand itself. All of nature is part of this process of understanding. Some day, the archotechs will voice their final wisdom to the holder of the %%relic0_name%%, who must preach this wisdom to those who would listen.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>GeometryA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.570, 0.470, 0.290, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
							<li>Proselytizer</li>
							<li>NaturePrimacy</li>
							<li>Shipborn</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>cutting trees</name>
								<def>TreeCutting_Horrible</def>
