						<adjective>archotechnic</adjective>
						<memberName>Archotechnist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Shining Archist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Shining Archist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Our universe is a simulation created by a great Outsider. Only archotechs can communicate directly with the Outsider. Archotechs transcend the limitations of planetbound life. In the end, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Our universe is a simulation created by a great Outsider. Only archotechs can communicate directly with the Outsider. Archotechs transcend the limitations of planetbound life. In the end, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
